# Internal architecture records and research evidence are kept in the repository,
# but they are not part of the published product documentation surface.
design/
proposals/

# Archived internal records keep that status. The archived plan page under
# archive/plans/ stays published; these records were never part of the
# published surface and do not become part of it by being archived.
archive/design/
archive/proposals/

# The internal review records under internal/ are not Mintlify pages either.
# Many are plain Markdown that MDX cannot parse, so `mint broken-links`, which
# CI's fmt-lint job runs on this directory, must skip them.
internal/
